	(text "Pull-up 4.7k 0.1 % (NTC 100K, pullup_resistor: 4700). Close JP = PT1000:\n4.7k // 4.12k = 2195 Ohm (pullup_resistor: 2195). Pull-ups on VREF_A = ADC reference.\n24 V on the input (heater wire touching the thermistor wire): 4.7k + BAT54S limit\nthe ADC pin current to ~4 mA; SMF30CA does not conduct at 24 V. Connector pin 2 = AGND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
